!insertmacro PakoEn pakoOtherOpen "Another Pako is open, so Pako's settings and lists were kept. To delete them, close that Pako, then delete the Pako folder in %LOCALAPPDATA%."
; [Pako] The line under the progress bar while Pako.exe is copied: "Copying Pako.exe... 40%".
; NSIS reads ^Extract in the language Setup started in, so with French on it holds a variable that
; Setup sets to the words of the language shown (installer/ui.nsh: PakoLangTexts).
!insertmacro PakoEn pakoExtract "Copying "
LangString ^Extract ${LANG_ENGLISH} "$PakoTxExtract"
